      "description": "Wittenberg University::: New Jobs http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/ New job postings from Wittenberg University en-us Sat, 05 Sep 2026 13:59:22 -0400 Sat, 05 Sep 2026 13:59:22 -0400 http://blogs.law.harvard.edu/tech/rss IE JSP-RSS info@interviewexchange.com (Hirezon Interview Exchange) info@interviewexchange.com (Hirezon Interview Exchange) Adjunct Faculty - Nursing 2026-2027 - Wittenberg University http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203123 Faculty Positions Nursing Academic / Faculty Adjunct <b> Location: </b> Springfield, OH <B> Category: </B> Faculty Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Adjunct <B> Posted On: </B> Wed Jul 29 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>Wittenberg University is seeking Adjunct Nursing Instructors to teach&nbsp;Pediatric and Medical/Surgical clinicals. Clinicals take place on varying Days of the week between&nbsp;7:00 a.m. and 5:00 p.m.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>To express&nbsp;interest, please submit your information electronically through our online application process described below.&nbsp; &nbsp;</p><a href=\"http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203123\"> more...</a> Springfield, OH Wed, 29 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=203123 Adjunct Faculty - Open Application Pool - Wittenberg University http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=185652 Faculty Positions Provost Academic / Faculty Adjunct <b> Location: </b> Springfield, OH <B> Category: </B> Faculty Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Adjunct <B> Posted On: </B> Thu Feb 20 2025 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>To express your interest in an adjunct faculty position beginning fall 2025, please submit your information electronically through our online application system.&nbsp; All submissions are acknowledged and kept in the system for one full academic year, after which they are purged. When part-time faculty openings occur in your area(s) of expertise, you may be contacted for additional information or to schedule an interview.&nbsp;</p><a href=\"http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=185652\"> more...</a> Springfield, OH Thu, 20 Feb 2025 00:00:00 -0500 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=185652 Area Coordinator -Campus Housing - Wittenberg University http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=204463 Administrative Positions Residence Life Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Springfield, OH <B> Category: </B> Administrative Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Fri Sep 4 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Area Coordinator at Wittenberg is a live-in, 12-month position with primary responsibility for the management of campus housing environments.&nbsp; The Student Development staff is dedicated to student growth and development outside of the classroom and considers Residence Life an integral part of this learning experience.&nbsp; In supporting the learning environment, the Area Coordinator is a role model, a facilitator, a leader, and an essential person in the effective operation of the residence life program. The Area Coordinator reports to the Director of Residence Life.&nbsp;<br>\r...<a href=\"http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=204463\"> more...</a> Springfield, OH Fri, 04 Sep 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=204463 Assistant Coach, Swimming & Diving and Aquatics Coordinator - Wittenberg University http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=204412 Administrative Positions Athletics Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Springfield, OH <B> Category: </B> Administrative Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Thu Sep 3 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>Wittenberg University is seeking applications for an Assistant Coach for Swimming & Diving and Aquatics Coordinator. This individual will assist the head coach in leading all aspects of an NCAA Division III Men's and Women's Swimming & Diving program, as well as lead the operational aspects of the aquatics operations.&nbsp; This is a full-time, 12-month, exempt-level&nbsp;position reporting to the Head Swimming & Diving&nbsp;Coach.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Essential functions include, but are not limited to:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul><li>Assist the head coach with practice and game-day preparation and execution...<a href=\"http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=204412\"> more...</a> Springfield, OH Thu, 03 Sep 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=204412 Assistant Director Of Enrollment Communications - Wittenberg University http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202865 Administrative Positions Admission Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Springfield, OH <B> Category: </B> Administrative Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Wed Jul 22 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Assistant Director of Enrollment Communications provides outreach of marketing and communication efforts to enroll every incoming class of students. Collaborates with the Director of Admission and Assistant Vice President for Enrollment Strategy, as well as Counselors to execute necessary communications needs and ensure they are built, targeted and delivered effectively to various audiences - students, families, schools, alumni and the greater campus community - to recruit the incoming class.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Essential duties include but not limited to are:&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Technology and Co...<a href=\"http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202865\"> more...</a> Springfield, OH Wed, 22 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=202865 Assistant Director, Donor and Philanthropic Services - Wittenberg University http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=200087 Administrative Positions Philanthropy and Alumni  Engagement Administrative and Professional Exempt <b> Location: </b> Springfield, OH <B> Category: </B> Administrative Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Exempt <B> Posted On: </B> Fri May 1 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>Provides operational leadership for the donor and operational services function within the Philanthropy and Alumni Engagement (PAE) division, with primary responsibility for the integrity, management, and optimization of the Salesforce constituent relationship management (CRM) system, gift processing operations, and data reporting. This position ensures that the division's data infrastructure supports effective fundraising, donor stewardship, and alumni engagement, and serves as a key resource and liaison to Finance, IT, and other campus partners on matters related to advancement data an...<a href=\"http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=200087\"> more...</a> Springfield, OH Fri, 01 May 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=200087 Assistant Director, Head Coach of E-Sports - Wittenberg University http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203757 Administrative Positions Student Development Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Springfield, OH <B> Category: </B> Administrative Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Sat Aug 15 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Assistant Director and Head Coach for Esports provides leadership and vision for the esports program, including building program goals and growing and maintaining operations. The Assistant Director will be responsible for recruiting, mentoring, and coaching student competitors for the four E-Sport rosters - Rocket League, Valorant, Rainbow 6, and Overwatch. E-Sports arena management and operations as well as building campus interest in, knowledge, and support of our competitive E-Sports teams. Manage and assess the possibility of competitve team expansion and the addition of recreati...<a href=\"http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203757\"> more...</a> Springfield, OH Sat, 15 Aug 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=203757 Assistant Director, Upward Bound - Wittenberg University http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202871 Administrative Positions Upward Bound Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Springfield, OH <B> Category: </B> Administrative Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Wed Jul 22 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>Wittenberg University is seeking an Assistant Director for the Upward Bound program. This individual will work with the Upward Bound staff in carrying out the essential operations of the program.&nbsp; This is a full-time, exempt&nbsp;position reporting to the Director of Upward Bound.<br>\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Essential functions include, but are not limited to:</p>\r\n\r\n<ol><li>Plan, coordinate, and execute a cultural and recreational program during the academic year and six-week summer component.</li><li>Carry out the responsibilities of the Director in their absence.&nbsp;</li><li>Work wit...<a href=\"http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202871\"> more...</a> Springfield, OH Wed, 22 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=202871 Associate Director External Partnerships, Lead Personal & Professional Development Coach - Wittenberg University http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203759 Administrative Positions Student Engagement Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Springfield, OH <B> Category: </B> Administrative Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Sat Aug 15 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Associate Director of External Partnerships & Lead Personal and Professional Development Coach combines leadership in external partnerships with hands-on coaching responsibilities to support the personal and professional growth of students. The Associate Director will use insights from student coaching to inform partnership development (e.g., aligning the right partners with student needs), bring partnership opportunities into coaching practice (e.g., connecting clients with external resources or networks), and will serve as a bridge between internal coaching teams and external stake...<a href=\"http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203759\"> more...</a> Springfield, OH Sat, 15 Aug 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=203759 Associate Director of Housing Operations - Wittenberg University http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=204082 Administrative Positions Residence Life Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Springfield, OH <B> Category: </B> Administrative Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Tue Aug 25 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Associate Director of Housing and Operations supports the mission of the University by managing the University's housing operations program under the leadership of the Associate Dean of Students and Director of Residence Life and in collaboration with other professional staff. The position manages housing operations for Wittenberg's fully residential campus. Professional staff members and student leaders work together to cultivate safe and inclusive living communities. This is a twelve-month, exempt-level position that includes evening and weekend responsibilities.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Essentia...<a href=\"http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=204082\"> more...</a> Springfield, OH Tue, 25 Aug 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=204082 Controller - Wittenberg University http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=199092 Administrative Positions Business Services Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Springfield, OH <B> Category: </B> Administrative Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Mon Apr 6 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>Wittenberg University is inviting applications for a Controller&nbsp;in the Business Services office. This individual facilitates timely, accurate reconciliations and internal/external financial reporting, manage annual audits and participate in the preparation of the University's Federal 990 filings. This individual will also be responsible for Endowment Accounting, overseeing the University's cash and asset management while helping to ensure the University operates efficiently and with sound business practices. Additional responsibilities will include participating in the annual budget...<a href=\"http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=199092\"> more...</a> Springfield, OH Mon, 06 Apr 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=199092 Director of Facilities Management - Wittenberg University http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=204146 Administrative Positions Facilities Management Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Springfield, OH <B> Category: </B> Administrative Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Wed Aug 26 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Director of Facilities Management supervises the skilled crafts team (electrical, plumbing, carpentry, HVAC, painting, and/or general maintenance) and operational building custodial team. The Director establishes work priorities and schedules to ensure maintenance, repairs, work orders and projects are completed in a safe and productive manner, and coordinates projects with vendors. This is a full-time, exempt-level position reporting to the Vice President of Administration.&nbsp;<br>\r\n<br>\r\nEssential functions include, but are not limited to:</p>\r\n\r\n<ol><li>Plans, organizes, oversee...<a href=\"http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=204146\"> more...</a> Springfield, OH Wed, 26 Aug 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=204146 Director, Campus Scheduling and Event Services - Wittenberg University http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203760 Administrative Positions Student Involvement Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Springfield, OH <B> Category: </B> Administrative Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Sun Aug 16 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>Wittenberg University is accepting applications for the position of Director,&nbsp;Campus Scheduling & Event Services. The position&nbsp;will provide administrative and logistical support to a variety of clients across the Wittenberg community through management and leadership of the University scheduling system.&nbsp; They will ensure the successful execution of different types of university events, workshops, meetings, classes, and facility spaces.&nbsp; This position is responsible for ensuring that the multitude of details and mechanics required to produce events that are successful ...<a href=\"http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203760\"> more...</a> Springfield, OH Sun, 16 Aug 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=203760 Director, Center for Personal and Professional Development - Wittenberg University http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203758 Administrative Positions Student Engagement Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Springfield, OH <B> Category: </B> Administrative Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Sat Aug 15 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Director of the Center for Personal and Professional Development provides strategic leadership, manages staff and budgets, designs and oversees training programs, and ensures alignment of initiatives with institutional priorities, objectives and goals.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Wittenberg Center for Personal and Professional Development (CPPD) is designed to help students grow both personally and professionally. \"Rooted and Open\" calls ELCA universities, rooted in Lutheran theology, to help students explore larger questions about their purpose and calling in life. The center offers structured an...<a href=\"http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203758\"> more...</a> Springfield, OH Sat, 15 Aug 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=203758 Lifeguard - Open Application Pool - Wittenberg University http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=181686 Support Staff Positions Athletics Office and Administrative Support Part-time Temporary <b> Location: </b> Springfield, OH <B> Category: </B> Support Staff Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Part-time Temporary <B> Posted On: </B> Thu Oct 3 2024 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>Wittenberg University is seeking temporary lifeguards to ensure the safety of student-athletes and patrons in the pool area. This is a non-exempt (hourly) position, reporting to the Assistant Coach - Swimming & Diving/Aquatics Coordinator. This is a temporary position, working no more than 20 hours per week, and is not eligible for university benefits.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Essential responsibilities include:</p>\r\n\r\n<ol><li>Supervise the pool area during swimming/diving practices, meets, and/or open swim time.&nbsp;</li><li>Ensure the safety and well-being of all patrons.</li>...<a href=\"http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=181686\"> more...</a> Springfield, OH Thu, 03 Oct 2024 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=181686 Part Time Assistant Men's Baseball Coach - Wittenberg University http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=204114 Administrative Positions Athletics Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Springfield, OH <B> Category: </B> Administrative Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Tue Aug 25 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>Wittenberg University is accepting applications for a part-time&nbsp;Assistant Men's Baseball Coach. The Assistant Coach assists the Head Coach with the daily operation of the men's baseball&nbsp;program in the NCAA Division III and the recruitment of student-athletes.&nbsp;This is a part position.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Essential functions include, but are not limited to:</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Coaching</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul><li>Assist the Head Coach with daily practice planning, game decisions, and player feedback and evaluation.</li><li>Perform video analysis and scouting of ...<a href=\"http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=204114\"> more...</a> Springfield, OH Tue, 25 Aug 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=204114 Part-time Assistant Coach, Men's Basketball - Wittenberg University http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=201953 Administrative Positions Athletics Administrative and Professional Part-time <b> Location: </b> Springfield, OH <B> Category: </B> Administrative Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Part-time <B> Posted On: </B> Fri Jun 26 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>Wittenberg University is seeking applications for a part-time&nbsp;Assistant Men's Basketball Coach. This individual will assist the head coach in leading all aspects of an NCAA Division III Men's Basketball&nbsp;program.&nbsp;This is a part-time, exempt-level&nbsp;position through July 31, 2027&nbsp;(with potential for renewal into the following year),&nbsp;reporting to the Head Men's Basketball Coach.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Essential functions include, but are not limited to:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul><li>Assist the head coach with practice and game-day preparation and execution.</li><li>Ev...<a href=\"http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=201953\"> more...</a> Springfield, OH Fri, 26 Jun 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=201953 Police Officer - Wittenberg University http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=200843 Police & Security Positions Police Classified Full-time Non-Exempt <b> Location: </b> Springfield, OH <B> Category: </B> Police & Security Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time Non-Exempt <B> Posted On: </B> Tue May 26 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>Wittenberg University is accepting applications for a full-time Police Officer position.&nbsp;<br>\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Essential functions include, but are not limited to:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul><li>Using courtesy and tact to encourage voluntary obedience&nbsp;of laws, ordinances and other university district needs.&nbsp;</li><li>Building and maintaining community policing relationships with the Wittenberg community along with participating in student engagement activities.&nbsp;</li><li>Enforcing federal and state laws, city ordinances and all other pertinent university and local regulations with&nbs...<a href=\"http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=200843\"> more...</a> Springfield, OH Tue, 26 May 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=200843 Police Officer - Wittenberg University http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=198805 Police & Security Positions Police Classified Full-time Non-Exempt <b> Location: </b> Springfield, OH <B> Category: </B> Police & Security Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time Non-Exempt <B> Posted On: </B> Thu Apr 2 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>Wittenberg University is accepting applications for a full-time Police Officer position.&nbsp;<br>\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Essential functions include, but are not limited to:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul><li>Using courtesy and tact to encourage voluntary obedience&nbsp;of laws, ordinances and other university district needs.&nbsp;</li><li>Building and maintaining community policing relationships with the Wittenberg community along with participating in student engagement activities.&nbsp;</li><li>Enforcing federal and state laws, city ordinances and all other pertinent university and local regulations with&nbs...<a href=\"http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=198805\"> more...</a> Springfield, OH Thu, 02 Apr 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=198805 Police Officer - Open Application Pool - Wittenberg University http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=177782 Other Positions Police Other Full-time <b> Location: </b> Springfield, OH <B> Category: </B> Other Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Fri Jun 14 2024 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p><strong>The Open Application Pool for the Wittenberg University Police Department is an online repository for applicants to post their resumes and other required documents. Applications from the Open Application Pool will be reviewed as openings arise. All applications will be kept on file for one full year after which they are purged.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>At all times our Police Officers are required to:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul><li>Use courtesy and tact to encourage voluntary obedience&nbsp;of laws, ordinances and other university district needs.&nbsp; Enforce federal and state laws, city ordinances a...<a href=\"http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=177782\"> more...</a> Springfield, OH Fri, 14 Jun 2024 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=177782 Professor of Practice, Nursing - Wittenberg University http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203073 Faculty Positions Nursing Academic / Faculty Exempt <b> Location: </b> Springfield, OH <B> Category: </B> Faculty Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Exempt <B> Posted On: </B> Tue Jul 28 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Nursing Department at Wittenberg University seeks to hire a full-time, professor of practice faculty member beginning January 1, 2027.&nbsp; Essential functions include, but are not limited to:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul><li>Teaching: Deliver courses as assigned (Pediatric, or Medical/Surgical Nursing, or Critical Care - Faculty teach across the curriculum). Demonstrate effective teaching as evidenced by Faculty and Course Evaluations by Students and Peer Reviews of Teaching. Teach 24 credit hours (tenure track) or 32 credit hours (professor of practice) in each academic year.</li><li>Nursing Clinic...<a href=\"http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203073\"> more...</a> Springfield, OH Tue, 28 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=203073 Student Financial Services Coordinator - Wittenberg University http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202861 Administrative Positions Admission Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Springfield, OH <B> Category: </B> Administrative Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Wed Jul 22 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Student Financial Services Coordinator serves as the primary point of contact for the Office of Student Financial Services, managing front-desk operations for both financial aid and student accounts. This position triages all incoming calls, emails, and walk-in inquiries; supervises student employees staffing the front desk; oversees the indexing of all student and family documents into the office's imaging system (Softdocs); and administers the Ohio State Grant program from eligibility determination through state reporting and reconciliation. This role requires strong customer servi...<a href=\"http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202861\"> more...</a> Springfield, OH Wed, 22 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=202861 Student Teaching University Supervisor - Open Application Pool - Wittenberg University http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=154246 Faculty Positions Education Academic / Faculty Adjunct <b> Location: </b> Springfield, OH <B> Category: </B> Faculty Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Adjunct <B> Posted On: </B> Thu Jun 1 2023 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>To express your interest in a Student Teaching University Supervisor position, please submit your information electronically through our online application system.&nbsp; All submissions are acknowledged and kept in the system for one full academic year, after which they are purged. When openings occur, you may be contacted for additional information or to schedule an interview.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\nThe Student Teaching University Supervisor is charged with supervising, mentoring, and collaborating with Wittenberg Student Teachers who are in their final phase of their undergraduate teach...<a href=\"http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=154246\"> more...</a> Springfield, OH Thu, 01 Jun 2023 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=154246"
    },
    "http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobsrss.jsp?COMPANYID=370&categoryID=669": {
      "title": "Wittenberg University::: New Jobs",
      "description": "Wittenberg University::: New Jobs http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/ New job postings from Wittenberg University en-us Sat, 05 Sep 2026 13:59:22 -0400 Sat, 05 Sep 2026 13:59:22 -0400 http://blogs.law.harvard.edu/tech/rss IE JSP-RSS info@interviewexchange.com (Hirezon Interview Exchange) info@interviewexchange.com (Hirezon Interview Exchange) Area Coordinator -Campus Housing - Wittenberg University http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=204463 Administrative Positions Residence Life Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Springfield, OH <B> Category: </B> Administrative Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Fri Sep 4 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Area Coordinator at Wittenberg is a live-in, 12-month position with primary responsibility for the management of campus housing environments.&nbsp; The Student Development staff is dedicated to student growth and development outside of the classroom and considers Residence Life an integral part of this learning experience.&nbsp; In supporting the learning environment, the Area Coordinator is a role model, a facilitator, a leader, and an essential person in the effective operation of the residence life program. The Area Coordinator reports to the Director of Residence Life.&nbsp;<br>\r...<a href=\"http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=204463\"> more...</a> Springfield, OH Fri, 04 Sep 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=204463 Assistant Coach, Swimming & Diving and Aquatics Coordinator - Wittenberg University http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=204412 Administrative Positions Athletics Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Springfield, OH <B> Category: </B> Administrative Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Thu Sep 3 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>Wittenberg University is seeking applications for an Assistant Coach for Swimming & Diving and Aquatics Coordinator. This individual will assist the head coach in leading all aspects of an NCAA Division III Men's and Women's Swimming & Diving program, as well as lead the operational aspects of the aquatics operations.&nbsp; This is a full-time, 12-month, exempt-level&nbsp;position reporting to the Head Swimming & Diving&nbsp;Coach.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Essential functions include, but are not limited to:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul><li>Assist the head coach with practice and game-day preparation and execution...<a href=\"http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=204412\"> more...</a> Springfield, OH Thu, 03 Sep 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=204412 Assistant Director Of Enrollment Communications - Wittenberg University http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202865 Administrative Positions Admission Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Springfield, OH <B> Category: </B> Administrative Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Wed Jul 22 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Assistant Director of Enrollment Communications provides outreach of marketing and communication efforts to enroll every incoming class of students. Collaborates with the Director of Admission and Assistant Vice President for Enrollment Strategy, as well as Counselors to execute necessary communications needs and ensure they are built, targeted and delivered effectively to various audiences - students, families, schools, alumni and the greater campus community - to recruit the incoming class.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Essential duties include but not limited to are:&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Technology and Co...<a href=\"http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202865\"> more...</a> Springfield, OH Wed, 22 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=202865 Assistant Director, Donor and Philanthropic Services - Wittenberg University http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=200087 Administrative Positions Philanthropy and Alumni  Engagement Administrative and Professional Exempt <b> Location: </b> Springfield, OH <B> Category: </B> Administrative Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Exempt <B> Posted On: </B> Fri May 1 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>Provides operational leadership for the donor and operational services function within the Philanthropy and Alumni Engagement (PAE) division, with primary responsibility for the integrity, management, and optimization of the Salesforce constituent relationship management (CRM) system, gift processing operations, and data reporting. This position ensures that the division's data infrastructure supports effective fundraising, donor stewardship, and alumni engagement, and serves as a key resource and liaison to Finance, IT, and other campus partners on matters related to advancement data an...<a href=\"http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=200087\"> more...</a> Springfield, OH Fri, 01 May 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=200087 Assistant Director, Head Coach of E-Sports - Wittenberg University http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203757 Administrative Positions Student Development Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Springfield, OH <B> Category: </B> Administrative Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Sat Aug 15 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Assistant Director and Head Coach for Esports provides leadership and vision for the esports program, including building program goals and growing and maintaining operations. The Assistant Director will be responsible for recruiting, mentoring, and coaching student competitors for the four E-Sport rosters - Rocket League, Valorant, Rainbow 6, and Overwatch. E-Sports arena management and operations as well as building campus interest in, knowledge, and support of our competitive E-Sports teams. Manage and assess the possibility of competitve team expansion and the addition of recreati...<a href=\"http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203757\"> more...</a> Springfield, OH Sat, 15 Aug 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=203757 Assistant Director, Upward Bound - Wittenberg University http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202871 Administrative Positions Upward Bound Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Springfield, OH <B> Category: </B> Administrative Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Wed Jul 22 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>Wittenberg University is seeking an Assistant Director for the Upward Bound program. This individual will work with the Upward Bound staff in carrying out the essential operations of the program.&nbsp; This is a full-time, exempt&nbsp;position reporting to the Director of Upward Bound.<br>\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Essential functions include, but are not limited to:</p>\r\n\r\n<ol><li>Plan, coordinate, and execute a cultural and recreational program during the academic year and six-week summer component.</li><li>Carry out the responsibilities of the Director in their absence.&nbsp;</li><li>Work wit...<a href=\"http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202871\"> more...</a> Springfield, OH Wed, 22 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=202871 Associate Director External Partnerships, Lead Personal & Professional Development Coach - Wittenberg University http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203759 Administrative Positions Student Engagement Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Springfield, OH <B> Category: </B> Administrative Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Sat Aug 15 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Associate Director of External Partnerships & Lead Personal and Professional Development Coach combines leadership in external partnerships with hands-on coaching responsibilities to support the personal and professional growth of students. The Associate Director will use insights from student coaching to inform partnership development (e.g., aligning the right partners with student needs), bring partnership opportunities into coaching practice (e.g., connecting clients with external resources or networks), and will serve as a bridge between internal coaching teams and external stake...<a href=\"http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203759\"> more...</a> Springfield, OH Sat, 15 Aug 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=203759 Associate Director of Housing Operations - Wittenberg University http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=204082 Administrative Positions Residence Life Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Springfield, OH <B> Category: </B> Administrative Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Tue Aug 25 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Associate Director of Housing and Operations supports the mission of the University by managing the University's housing operations program under the leadership of the Associate Dean of Students and Director of Residence Life and in collaboration with other professional staff. The position manages housing operations for Wittenberg's fully residential campus. Professional staff members and student leaders work together to cultivate safe and inclusive living communities. This is a twelve-month, exempt-level position that includes evening and weekend responsibilities.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Essentia...<a href=\"http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=204082\"> more...</a> Springfield, OH Tue, 25 Aug 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=204082 Controller - Wittenberg University http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=199092 Administrative Positions Business Services Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Springfield, OH <B> Category: </B> Administrative Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Mon Apr 6 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>Wittenberg University is inviting applications for a Controller&nbsp;in the Business Services office. This individual facilitates timely, accurate reconciliations and internal/external financial reporting, manage annual audits and participate in the preparation of the University's Federal 990 filings. This individual will also be responsible for Endowment Accounting, overseeing the University's cash and asset management while helping to ensure the University operates efficiently and with sound business practices. Additional responsibilities will include participating in the annual budget...<a href=\"http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=199092\"> more...</a> Springfield, OH Mon, 06 Apr 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=199092 Director of Facilities Management - Wittenberg University http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=204146 Administrative Positions Facilities Management Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Springfield, OH <B> Category: </B> Administrative Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Wed Aug 26 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Director of Facilities Management supervises the skilled crafts team (electrical, plumbing, carpentry, HVAC, painting, and/or general maintenance) and operational building custodial team. The Director establishes work priorities and schedules to ensure maintenance, repairs, work orders and projects are completed in a safe and productive manner, and coordinates projects with vendors. This is a full-time, exempt-level position reporting to the Vice President of Administration.&nbsp;<br>\r\n<br>\r\nEssential functions include, but are not limited to:</p>\r\n\r\n<ol><li>Plans, organizes, oversee...<a href=\"http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=204146\"> more...</a> Springfield, OH Wed, 26 Aug 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=204146 Director, Campus Scheduling and Event Services - Wittenberg University http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203760 Administrative Positions Student Involvement Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Springfield, OH <B> Category: </B> Administrative Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Sun Aug 16 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>Wittenberg University is accepting applications for the position of Director,&nbsp;Campus Scheduling & Event Services. The position&nbsp;will provide administrative and logistical support to a variety of clients across the Wittenberg community through management and leadership of the University scheduling system.&nbsp; They will ensure the successful execution of different types of university events, workshops, meetings, classes, and facility spaces.&nbsp; This position is responsible for ensuring that the multitude of details and mechanics required to produce events that are successful ...<a href=\"http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203760\"> more...</a> Springfield, OH Sun, 16 Aug 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=203760 Director, Center for Personal and Professional Development - Wittenberg University http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203758 Administrative Positions Student Engagement Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Springfield, OH <B> Category: </B> Administrative Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Sat Aug 15 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Director of the Center for Personal and Professional Development provides strategic leadership, manages staff and budgets, designs and oversees training programs, and ensures alignment of initiatives with institutional priorities, objectives and goals.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Wittenberg Center for Personal and Professional Development (CPPD) is designed to help students grow both personally and professionally. \"Rooted and Open\" calls ELCA universities, rooted in Lutheran theology, to help students explore larger questions about their purpose and calling in life. The center offers structured an...<a href=\"http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203758\"> more...</a> Springfield, OH Sat, 15 Aug 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=203758 Part Time Assistant Men's Baseball Coach - Wittenberg University http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=204114 Administrative Positions Athletics Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Springfield, OH <B> Category: </B> Administrative Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Tue Aug 25 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>Wittenberg University is accepting applications for a part-time&nbsp;Assistant Men's Baseball Coach. The Assistant Coach assists the Head Coach with the daily operation of the men's baseball&nbsp;program in the NCAA Division III and the recruitment of student-athletes.&nbsp;This is a part position.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Essential functions include, but are not limited to:</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Coaching</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul><li>Assist the Head Coach with daily practice planning, game decisions, and player feedback and evaluation.</li><li>Perform video analysis and scouting of ...<a href=\"http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=204114\"> more...</a> Springfield, OH Tue, 25 Aug 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=204114 Part-time Assistant Coach, Men's Basketball - Wittenberg University http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=201953 Administrative Positions Athletics Administrative and Professional Part-time <b> Location: </b> Springfield, OH <B> Category: </B> Administrative Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Part-time <B> Posted On: </B> Fri Jun 26 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>Wittenberg University is seeking applications for a part-time&nbsp;Assistant Men's Basketball Coach. This individual will assist the head coach in leading all aspects of an NCAA Division III Men's Basketball&nbsp;program.&nbsp;This is a part-time, exempt-level&nbsp;position through July 31, 2027&nbsp;(with potential for renewal into the following year),&nbsp;reporting to the Head Men's Basketball Coach.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Essential functions include, but are not limited to:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul><li>Assist the head coach with practice and game-day preparation and execution.</li><li>Ev...<a href=\"http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=201953\"> more...</a> Springfield, OH Fri, 26 Jun 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=201953 Student Financial Services Coordinator - Wittenberg University http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202861 Administrative Positions Admission Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Springfield, OH <B> Category: </B> Administrative Positions <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Wed Jul 22 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>The Student Financial Services Coordinator serves as the primary point of contact for the Office of Student Financial Services, managing front-desk operations for both financial aid and student accounts. This position triages all incoming calls, emails, and walk-in inquiries; supervises student employees staffing the front desk; oversees the indexing of all student and family documents into the office's imaging system (Softdocs); and administers the Ohio State Grant program from eligibility determination through state reporting and reconciliation. This role requires strong customer servi...<a href=\"http://wittenberg.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=202861\"> more...</a> Springfield, OH Wed, 22 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=202861"
